id: genetic-focus-majins
name: Genetic Focus: Majins
order: 10
category: body
# "[Uncanny Monster]": it replaces that Primary Racial Trait - which, the table's. (1) Its Prerequisite, the Majin Genes Factor Trait,
# shown and never enforced.
importance: primary
# Its own description was given cut short ("T"): asked for.
text: >
  Genetic Focus: Majins (Body) [Uncanny Monster]:
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: Majins Genes Factor Trait
  (2)-[Passive]: Gain access to a Majin Secondary Trait of your choice. That Trait cannot be traded out for Factor Traits.
  (3)-[Passive]: You may use your Magic Modifier instead of your Force Modifier when calculating Surgency (see — Surges).
  (4)-[Passive]: Increase your Soak Value and Defense Value by 1(T).
  (5)-[Triggered/Threshold]: Spend an Adaptation Point to use a Healing Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  (6)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use a Healing Surge, maximize your Adaptation Points. Then, you may use any Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
---

[passive]
# (2) The Majin Secondary Trait added by hand from the Traits tab, as any Racial Trait is; that it cannot be traded, the table's.
# (3) Where the Magic Modifier is the higher (actor-character.mjs) - Priest's.
allow surgency.magic;
# (4)
soakValue += 1(T);
defenseValue += 1(T);
# (6) A Healing Surge used: asked, once an Encounter - your Adaptation Points to their Maximum, then an "Out of Sequence" button on your
# Standard Maneuvers of 1 Action this Round, for one (chat.mjs focusMajinSurge). The Encounter's one, and an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver: no
# button (the user's).
allow focusMajins.surge;

# (5) Knocked through a Health Threshold, with an Adaptation Point: a Healing Surge out of sequence for it - chosen, never Automatic.
[triggered/threshold, outOfSequence, effect 5]
requires hasResource("adaptation");
adaptation.stacks -= 1;
surge(healing);
